<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Upcoming Payment Reminder for Your Property in {!relatedTo.ProjectName__c} - {!relatedTo.Unit__r.Name}" recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="SalesOrder__c" >
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
    <html>
        <body>
            <table style="text-align:justify;width: 100%;"> 
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       Dear <b><!--Client/Customer's Name--> {{ownerName}},</b> 
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       Thank you for your continued trust in Modon and for investing in Nawayef West, one of our flagship developments.
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                   We would like to inform you that your next installment of <c:getEquity salesOrder="{!relatedTo.Id}" emailReminder="Downpayment Reminder" />% (<c:getInstalmentValue salesOrder="{!relatedTo.Id}" emailReminder="Downpayment Reminder"/>) for your unit {!relatedTo.Unit__r.Name} will be collected on 10th Sep 2025.
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       Kindly ensure that sufficient funds are available in your account for the post-dated cheque to be processed on the revised date.
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <!--
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       If you wish to provide a replacement cheque, you may visit our office at the address mentioned in the signature below. Kindly bring a cheque dated <b>30-Apr-2025</b> and collect your expired cheque dated <b>30-Sep-2024</b>. We request that you complete this exchange by <b>Friday, 25-Apr-2025</b> to ensure timely processing of the payment.  
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       To better align with the re-sequenced construction activities, we have made adjustments to the payment schedule. These changes are intended to streamline the process and support completion of the project as soon as possible. 
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       <table style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;background-color:#d1d1d1;"><b>Instalment No.</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;background-color:#d1d1d1;"><b>Instalment Milestone</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;background-color:#d1d1d1;"><b>Payment %</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;background-color:#d1d1d1;"><b>SPA Date</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;background-color:#d1d1d1;"><b>New Instalment Date</b></td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">5</td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">50% of Unit Superstructure Completion</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">5%</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">31-Mar-25</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">31-Jul-25</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">6</td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">100% of Unit Superstructure Completion</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">5%</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">30-Nov-25</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">28-Feb-26</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">7</td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">Unit Façade Substantial Completion</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">5%</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">31-Mar-26</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">30-Jun-26</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">8</td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">On Completion Date</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">60%</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">31-May-26</td>
                               <td style="text-align:center;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">31-Dec-26</td>
                           </tr>
                       </table>
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       <b>
                       <ul>
                           <li>Unit No: {!relatedTo.Inventory_Unit__r.Name}</li>
                           <li>Scheduled Payment Number: Instalment Number 4</li>
                           <li>Payment Due Date: 30-Apr-25</li>
                           
                           <li>Payment Percentage: 5</li>
                       </ul>
                       </b>
                   </td>
               </tr>
               -->
               <!--<tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>-->
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       <br/>For International and Non-Resident Investor, Please make payment by bank transfer. Be sure to include your unit number in the description and share the proof of transfer on email to <a href="mailto:collections@modon.com">collections@modon.com</a>, so that we can accurately track and record your payment.
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <!--<tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       <table style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>ACCOUNT TITLE</b></td>
                               
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.Name}</td>
                               
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>ACCOUNT NUMBER</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.VirtualAccountNumber__c}</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>IBAN</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">{!relatedTo.VirtualAccount__r.VirtualIBANNumber__c}</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>BANK</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">FIRST ABU DHABI BANK (FAB)</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>BRANCH</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">HEAD OFFICE, PO BOX 6316, ABU DHABI, UAE</td>
                           </tr>
                           <tr>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;"><b>SWIFT CODE</b></td>
                               <td style="text-align:left;border:1px solid black;padding:5px;">NBADAEAA</td>
                           </tr>
                       </table>
                   </td>
               </tr>-->
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                         <b>Bank Details:</b>
                   </td>
               </tr>
               
                <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
                <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                           <b>Account Number:</b> 7415000440100225<br/>
                           <b>IBAN Number:</b> AE670357415000440100225<br/>
                           <b>Curency:</b> AED<br/>
                           <b>Bank Name:</b> First Abu Dhabi Bank PJSC <!--<c:getInstalmentValue salesOrder="{!relatedTo.Id}" emailReminder="{!relatedTo.Email_Reminder__c}"/>--><br/>
                           <b>Swift Code:</b> NBADAEAA<br/>
                   </td>
               </tr>
               
               <!--<tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       To confirm your payment and ensure accuracy, kindly reply to <a href="mailto:collections@modon.com">collections@modon.com</a>  with the receipt (proof of payment) or transaction reference number once the payment has been processed.
                   </td>
               </tr>
               
               
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       If a <b>Third Party</b> is making the payment on behalf of the unit’s owner, please reply to this email so that we can share the Third-Party Consent Form with you to fill out the form and send it back along with the proof of payment to ensure accurate and efficient processing.
                   </td>
               </tr>-->
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       For more information and immediate assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us on 800-MODON (66366) or visit our Customer Management on the 20th floor of Al Maryah Tower. <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maryah+Tower/@24.49841,54.3906064,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5e67acdf150f29:0x5f4ca7797b069048!8m2!3d24.49841!4d54.3906064!16s%2Fg%2F11f03pn0pd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDQxNC4xIKXMDSoJLDEwMjExNDUzSAFQAw%3D%3D">Click here for location</a>.
                   </td>
               </tr>
      
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                          &nbsp;
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       Warm Regards,
                   </td>
               </tr>
                <tr>
                   <td colspan="2">
                       <br/><b>Modon Customer Management</b>
                       <br/>
                   </td>
               </tr>
               <tr>
                   <td colspan="2" align="left">
                       <a href="reemhills.com" target="_blank"><img align="center" src="https://alqudra.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015J7000000xAkm&oid=00D8d000002dU2e&lastMod=1745230594000" width="100%" /></a>
                   </td>
